      "refersTo": "hero-card",
      "description": "The dark Asphalt Panel with the car name in wide caps, overlapping the foot of the car image.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hero\"><div class=\"ds-hero-card\"><div class=\"ds-hero-pills\"><span>Booked</span><span class=\"ds-on-danger\">Delivery at risk</span></div><h1>Volkswagen ID.4</h1><p>BX-24117 · Nordwind Leasing · <b>1,104 km</b></p></div></div>",
      "css": ":root{--birch:#fffef7;--sand-50:#f1eee6;--sand-100:#e2ded4;--sand-200:#ccc6ba;--grey-500:#8a7f6b;--muted:#685f4f;--brown:#5a5346;--body:#2a2721;--ink:#12110e;--ease:cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)}.ds-hero{font-family:Figtree,'Duplet Open',system-ui,sans-serif;padding-top:60px;border-radius:24px;background:#e2ded4}.ds-hero-card{margin:0 20px;padding:28px 32px 30px;border-radius:24px;background:rgba(30,28,23,.96);color:#fffef7}.ds-hero-pills{display:flex;gap:8px}.ds-hero-pills span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:26px;padding:0 11px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;background:rgba(255,254,247,.12)}.ds-hero-pills .ds-on-danger{background:#ff8e9d;color:#12110e}.ds-hero-card h1{margin:16px 0 0;font-family:Archivo,'Owners Wide',system-ui,sans-serif;font-stretch:125%;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 125;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:.98;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,64px)}.ds-hero-card p{margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;color:#ccc6ba}.ds-hero-card b{font-weight:600;color:#fffef7}"
